      "text": "Overall an excellent video, it gave a good overview of the nation and I really liked the attention to all the cities which are often forgotten in Suisse travel videos.  A few mistakes, it was the Bernina Express train that you called the Glacier Express, and the Matterhorn in not visible from Geneva, but Mt Blanc, the highest mountain in the Alps located just outside Suisse in France, is plainly visible.  Also Aletch Glacier is visible from the top of the Jungfraujoch Railway near Interlaken, it is not visible from the valley of Zermatt.  But overall a very good introduction  with lots of good scenic nature and city and town scenes.",
